Bump version to 0.2.0 for the feature-parity release

This build closes the macOS feature-parity gap (recording overlay, sounds,
system tray, launch-at-login, press-enter, voice macros, run-log viewer,
paste-again, robust clipboard paste, expanded settings, and a first-run
onboarding wizard), so the version moves from 0.1.0 to 0.2.0.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
